Start UAV api Server: 
$ cd uav/
$ python3 -m venv sundarban_uav_env
$ source sundarban_uav_env/bin/activate
$ pip install -r requirements.txt
$ python3 -m uvicorn uav:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 7999

1. Fly to coordinates (/fly_track)
curl -X POST http://127.0.0.1:7999/fly_track -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{"track_id": 101}'

- Above curl takes the lat logns fromt radar kafka topic if available otherwise defaults.

2. RTL command (/rtl)
curl "http://127.0.0.1:7999/rtl"

